{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/UsingIvorConnect"],"title":"Guides","anchor":"Guides"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIDestinationOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDISourceOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput"],"title":"Outputs","anchor":"Outputs"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDISourceInput"],"title":"Input","anchor":"Input"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIDeviceDiscovery"],"title":"Devices","anchor":"Devices"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIRouter","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIOutputChoice"],"title":"Routing","anchor":"Routing"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIScheduler","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDISequence","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDISequencePlayer"],"title":"Playback","anchor":"Playback"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIClient","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIDestination","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDISource"],"title":"CoreMIDI","anchor":"CoreMIDI"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The IvorConnect framework sends "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/eBardX\/IvorMIDI","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"channel and system messages, each timestamped for the moment it should sound,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to CoreMIDI and to Apple’s multitimbral MIDI synth. Every destination is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIOutput","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDISourceOutput","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" publishes a virtual source that other apps can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"connect to.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIDestinationOutput","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" sends to one CoreMIDI destination (a synth,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an interface, another app), and finds it again whenever it comes back.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" plays on AUMIDISynth with a General MIDI sound bank,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placing every message at its exact sample.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIRouter","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" delivers each message to its channel’s outputs, keeping"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timestamps in order across all of them, so that a note-off sent “now” can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"never overtake a note-on already scheduled. A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIClient","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"available destinations and reports every change to the MIDI setup."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import IvorConnect","i